      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...if:  (a) the court has made a *preliminary unexplained wealth order in relation to the person; and  (b) the court is not satisfied that the whole or any part of the person’s *wealth was not derived from one or more of the following:",
