      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(2A) If the *Official Trustee is satisfied that:  (a) the balance of the *Confiscated Assets Account is insufficient to pay the legal costs; and  (b) property of the person is covered by the *restraining order; the Official Trustee must pay the legal costs (according to the bill) to the *legal aid commission out of that property covered by the order, to the extent possible.",
